@startuml


title Online Cinema Platform – Service Prototype Architecture

top to bottom direction

actor User
actor Admin

package "Docker Network: app-network" {

  component "NGINX\n(Reverse Proxy)" as nginx

  together {
    component "Django Admin\n(movies_admin)" as django
    component "FastAPI App\n(API Gateway / Public API)" as fastapi
  }

  component "Auth Service" as auth
  component "ETL Worker" as etl

  database "Theatre DB\n(PostgreSQL)" as theatre_db
  database "Auth DB\n(PostgreSQL)" as auth_db
  database "Redis\n(Cache / Queue)" as redis
  database "Auth Redis" as auth_redis
  database "Elasticsearch\n(Search / Analytics)" as es

  component "Jaeger\n(Tracing)" as jaeger
}

User --> nginx : HTTP(S)
Admin --> nginx : HTTP(S)

nginx --> django : Admin UI
nginx --> fastapi : Public API

django --> auth : Auth requests
fastapi --> auth : Auth requests

auth --> auth_db : users / tokens
auth --> auth_redis : sessions
auth --> jaeger : traces

django --> theatre_db : ORM queries
django --> redis : cache (optional)

fastapi --> es : search / read models
fastapi --> redis : cache / pub-sub
fastapi --> jaeger : traces

theatre_db --> etl : source data
etl --> redis : consume tasks
etl --> es : index data
etl --> fastapi : health dependency

note left of etl
ETL starts only after:
- FastAPI healthy
- Redis healthy
- Elasticsearch healthy
end note

@enduml
